-- item_master is the legacy twin of `items`: the app writes to `items`
-- (customer_item_prices.item_id -> items.id) but invoice_items.item_id still
-- foreign-keys to item_master.id, and several report pages fall back to
-- reading it.  It must hold the same ids or the invoice insert fails.
-- Live shape differs from `items`:
--   id            bigint, NO default  -> no OVERRIDING needed, no sequence
--   opening_stock / minimum_stock are INTEGER (items uses numeric)
